          "value": "<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_Rollins\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Henry Rollins\">Henry Rollins</a> being interviewed by <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IndieWire\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:IndieWire\">IndieWire</a></i> editor-in-chief Dana Harris-Bridson, in promotion of the 2015 horror film that marked his first leading role, <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/He_Never_Died\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:He Never Died\">He Never Died</a></i>, which was set to premiere at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_by_Southwest\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:South by Southwest\">SXSW</a>. The interview took place on March 17, the final day of the SXSW Film Conference at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austin_Convention_Center\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Austin Convention Center\">Austin Convention Center</a> in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austin,_Texas\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Austin, Texas\">Austin</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Texas\">Texas</a>.",
